# IMP002 - Improve Product Quantity Selection in Product Page


## Problem Description
The system does not provide a clear and intuitive option to increase the quantity of a product directly from the product page before adding it to the cart.

Users are required to add the product first and then adjust the quantity in the cart, which reduces usability efficiency.


## Impact on User
This flow may reduce user experience efficiency, especially for users who want to purchase multiple units of the same product quickly.
It creates unnecessary steps in the shopping process.


## Recommendation
Add a quantity selector (e.g., "+" and "-" buttons or input field) directly on the product page before clicking "Add to cart".


## Expected Benefit
- Improved user experience (UX)
- Faster product selection process
- Reduced number of steps to complete a purchase
- More intuitive shopping flow


